        "Gold members get 1 point every time u leave the house.",
        "U have 0 points.",
        "Pls do not check the app to see if this is correct. We know it is not correct.",
        { "choices": [
          {
            "text": "I never leave. What do I get?",
            "say": [
              "Gold perk: a free cardboard box with ur name on it. Ur name is spelled wrong. Its spelled DICKHEAD.",
              { "do": "deliver", "item": "Cardboard_Box", "after": 30 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "I dont want to be gold.",
            "say": "U are gold now. Gold is forever. Gold is ur whole life now, like a pennis in a gold ring."
          },
          { "text": "Ok.", "say": "U r welcome. Stay home. Keep ur pennis in ur pants." }
        ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "order-refund",
      "subject": "ur refund is here (maybe)",
      "send": { "trigger": "order", "store": "Normal", "delay": 900 },
      "body": [
