        "Rail Mail GOLD members get the same deal as Rail Mail SILVER members. Its the same deal. Ur pennis gets the same deal too.",
        { "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Get railed.",
            "say": [ "<size=150%>YES!!!<size=100%>", "Thank u. We will rail u daily now. Its not a threat. Its a promise." ]
